# Lurrus of the Dream-Den in a sideboard is a companion only if it was chosen as one when the deck was built (CR 103.2b: the
# player reveals it; here, at deck building). Bot1's deck of Swamps would fulfil its condition, but Bot1 chose no companion:
# the Lurrus is a sideboard card, nothing is revealed, and there is no companion to take, though Bot1 has the mana.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Swamp x26

[Bot1 Sideboard]
Lurrus of the Dream-Den

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x27

[Actions]
? Bot1.Companion =
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Sideboard.Lurrus of the Dream-Den.TakeCompanion

[Expect]
Bot1.Companion =
Bot1.Sideboard = Lurrus of the Dream-Den
